# RailPlan runs entirely without configuration. The constraint engine, solver
# and every metric are pure TypeScript and need no credentials.
#
# The planner assistant is the one optional extra. Without a key it answers from
# the engine using templates — correct, just terser. With one, answers are
# written by Claude and still constrained to figures the engine produced.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#
# An `ant auth login` profile under ~/.config/anthropic is picked up
# automatically and needs nothing here.
